HST Office: write and edit VBA macros in HST Writer and HST Sheets like in Microsoft Office.

- sw/uiconfig/swriter/ui/notebookbar.ui, sc/uiconfig/scalc/ui/notebookbar.ui: a large
  "Macro VBA" button first in the Macro group of the Tools tab (Công cụ). It dispatches
  org.hst.office.vi:EditVba of the bundled HST extension, which opens the Basic IDE on the
  document's VBA module and creates one ("Option VBASupport 1" + Vietnamese template) when
  there is none. Label and tooltip are Vietnamese in every UI language (HST command); the
  label fallback for extension commands comes from hst-ribbon-nd30.patch.
- officecfg Common.xcs: MacroSecurityLevel default 1 (Medium) instead of 2 (High). With High,
  macros of an .xlsm/.docm from someone else are blocked without a choice; Medium shows the
  security prompt and runs them only when the user agrees. Never silent. Profiles that store
  a level keep it.
- oovbaapi word/XRange.idl, sw/source/ui/vba/vbarange.*: Range.InsertBefore / Range.InsertAfter,
  the most common Word VBA calls that were missing ("Property or method not found"); as in
  Word, the range grows to include the inserted text.
- sw/source/filter/ww8/docxexport.*: saving as .docm wrote only the VBA project read from the
  original file, so macros written or edited in HST Writer were lost. When the document is in
  VBA mode the current Basic code is now written with oox::ole::VbaExport (as Calc does for
  .xlsm). A project with UserForms (designer storages, which VbaExport cannot write) is still
  copied unchanged; vbaData.xml is then omitted because it could name stale macros.
- sc/source/filter/excel/excrecds.cxx, excdoc.cxx: .xlsx/.xlsm export writes the VBA code names
  (sheetPr codeName, workbookPr codeName). Without them the document modules Sheet1/ThisWorkbook
  lost their sheets after a save, so Worksheet_Change / Workbook_Open no longer ran and Excel
  saw orphaned modules.

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
Test: tests/runtime/check-vba.py (compatibility matrix, .xlsm/.docm/.ods/.odt round trip, events,
defaults), tests/unit/test_vba_authoring.py.
